  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "品牌與時尚學",
    "sub_ename": "BRAND AND FASHION",
    "describe_ch": "本課程是學習品牌建構。流行時尚產業是高附加價值的產業，其品牌發展的脈絡與策略是培養品牌行銷專業的標竿學習個案。結合美學、創意學、零售、廣告等行銷管理的串聯式基礎課程，以品牌設計為一整體的商業表現方式，引導學生，學習設計品牌價值，提昇品牌知名度的能力。本課程以小組報告與評量培育學生國際品牌經營策略，品牌打造，行銷核心職能，以及懂得行銷藝術的行銷人。",
    "describe_eh": "This course is designed to deliver marketing students the branding strategy and the rich context of fashion business that is highly aesthetics consumer product. The course analyses the segmentation behind strategies for fashion products, the emotional aspects of fashion communication and positioning, the psychological aspect of pricing issues, brand personality & fashion design, window display and retailing setting, short circuit distribution, brand relationship and CRM, etc. This course help students to understand the brand image construction and product value in marketing principle.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "觀察國際時尚流行與品牌經營最新趨勢",
      "describe_en": "Observes the international fashion to be popular and brand management newest tendency"
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "學習對時尚品牌的風格設計之審美判斷力",
      "describe_en": "Learning judgment of taste on style elements of fashion brands."
    }
